    "preamble": "Lokendra Pal Singh@ Lokpal Singh vs State Of U.P. And Another on 1 July, 2022 Author: Saurabh Shyam Shamshery Bench: Saurabh Shyam Shamshery High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Court No. - 42 Case :- Application U/S 482 No. - 18661 of 2022 Applicant :- Lokendra Pal Singh@ Lokpal Singh Opposite Party :- State of U.P. and Another Counsel for Applicant :- Rajesh Kumar Counsel for Opposite Party :- G.A. Hon'ble Saurabh Shyam Shamshery,J. 1.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "3. Shri Rajesh Kumar, learned counsel for the applicant submits that N.B.W has been issued against the applicant vide order dated 23.10.2013 in the case arising out of offence under Food Adulteration and Prevention Act. He further submits that applicant is ready to appear before the concerned Trial Court. He prayed that N.B.W. issued against the applicant be kept in abeyance.",
